        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="ventilation" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Production of a ventilation unit (air handling unit) with 3500 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger), component weight: 965 kg, total weight: 1164 kg/Unit, including average components for controls, inverter and electric control cabinet, material for 20 filter replacements (once a year for 20 years lifetime). The air handling unit includes a frame construction, two radial belt drive fans, two multi-leaf damper, heat recovery with circuit connected heat exchanger, heating elements, expansion plenum and empty section in supply and extract air. No cooling elements, humidifier, air-mixing plenum and silencer included. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam. Circuit connected heat exchanger for completely separated supply air and exhaust air streams.;&#10;UUID: 58c96545-0b1a-3ac1-b8f7-9de6ad5f5500" includedProcesses="Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included." infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="ventilation" localName="Ventilation unit 3500 m3/h, w. circuit connected heat exchanger, at plant" localSubCategory="production of components" name="Ventilation unit 3500 m3/h, w. circuit connected heat exchanger, at plant" subCategory="production of components" unit="p"/>
